# Docker build context（Manage-platform_Agent/nuxt-agent 从仓库根构建）
**/.git
**/.data
**/.output
**/.nuxt
**/node_modules
**/dist
!LobsterPy_Agent/frontend/dist
!LobsterPy_Agent/frontend/dist/**
!ExtractorPy_Agent/frontend/dist
!ExtractorPy_Agent/frontend/dist/**
**/.cursor
**/terminals
**/*.md
!LobsterPy_Agent/README.md
!Manage-platform_Agent/docker/**
# Nuxt Agent 运行时 skills（skill.md）必须进镜像；**/*.md 会掏空 skills 目录
!**/*_Agent/skills/**
!**/*Agent/skills/**
# 本地 junction/软链：勿覆盖镜像内 COPY shared 得到的目录
Extractor_Agent/agent-repo-shared
Manager_Agent/agent-repo-shared
